      "name": "Little Voices",
      "summary": "Sing-along songs and nursery rhymes with AAC picture symbols, for children ages 3–7 and every kind of voice. Each song is a card: lyrics with picture-marked key words, a flip book, a melody player, picture games, questions at three levels and printable worksheets. Open the library to browse songs by month or category, tap a picture to hear its word, and play the choice boards at Beginner, Intermediate or Advanced level. Add a new song and it appears in the library on its own.",
